{"pageid": 927, "title": "Adda Slaughter", "revid": 2691, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Deceased", "Black Masks", "Monster hunters", "House of Slaughter", "Order of St. George", "Characters (BOS comics)", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Adda Slaughter</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/AddaSlaughter.png/revision/latest?cb=20241229024820\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"AddaSlaughter\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/AddaSlaughter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241229024820\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/AddaSlaughter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241229024820 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/AddaSlaughter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241229024820 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"AddaSlaughter\" width=\"270\" height=\"309\" data-image-key=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" data-image-name=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Mask\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Black_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20241130215907\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Black Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Black_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> — <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mask\" title=\"Black Mask\">Black</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Masks\">Black Mask</a> Hunter of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"totem\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Totem</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Wuppy Puppy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV3VwcHlfUHVwcHk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Wuppy Puppy</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #17</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">Back in the day, she was unstoppable. The unstoppable <i>Adda Slaughter.</i> She was my hero. I'll tell <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">you</a> some of the good stories sometime.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—<a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a> , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> 17</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Adelaide \"Adda\" Slaughter</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Masks\">Black Mask</a> Hunter of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>. She was a fierce and powerful hunter who trained <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a>, though the latter would later transfer to the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Masks\">White Mask</a> branch. In her elderly age, Adda would be succeeded as the Head of the Black Masks by Jessica, who would care for her until her death.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Adda was a hunter under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>, and would eventually become the leader of the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Masks\">Black Masks</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>. Her <a href=\"/wiki/Totems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totems\">totem</a> was a stuffed dog, named <span class=\"new\" title=\"Wuppy Puppy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV3VwcHlfUHVwcHk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Wuppy Puppy</span>. \n</p><p>She was noted to be the trainer of both <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a>;<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC17&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC17-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> she did not train many apprentices, due to her fear for the emotional toll the job could take on a person.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Cecilia would eventually become a <a href=\"/wiki/White_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Masks\">White Mask</a>, leaving Adda and Jessica alone until Jessica would accept <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron</a> as an apprentice. Eventually, Adelaide would become elderly and wheelchair-bound, and would retire and remain living in the House of Slaughter. By the time <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> entered the House (c. 2000), she was silent and spent most of her time staring out the window. This was a product of both her age and the trauma she experienced during her time hunting. She started crying upon seeing the new recruit, and Jessica promised that she wouldn't let anything bad happen to her.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC17&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC17-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Even after her death, her wheelchair would remain in the Black Room of the House.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOS&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOS-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">Issue #17</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books_of_Slaughter\"><i>Books of Slaughter</i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"07d6d12668eaa99ed5f73df8578b62f2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"AddaSlaughter-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:161px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:AddaSlaughter.png\" title=\"AddaSlaughter.png (1,009 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:161px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/AddaSlaughter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/161?cb=20241229024820\" title=\"AddaSlaughter.png (1,009 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children #17\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" data-image-key=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"AddaSlaughter.png (1,009 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children #17\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" data-image-key=\"AddaSlaughter.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8e/A